{{page-title (concat (this.locale.t "dropdown.polyaspartic") " - " (this.locale.t "dropdown.polyWaterproof") " | CleanTech")}}

<article class="page margin-page">
  <div class="container-app">
    <section
      class="space-y-4 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white/90 p-10 shadow-xl shadow-blue-500/10 backdrop-blur"
    >
      <p class="coming-soon-badge">{{this.locale.t "dropdown.comingSoon"}}</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold leading-tight text-slate-900">{{this.locale.t "dropdown.polyaspartic"}} — {{this.locale.t "dropdown.polyWaterproof"}}</h1>
      <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
        {{#if this.locale.isKorean}}
          폴리아스파틱 방수재 제품 페이지를 준비 중입니다. 제품 정보와 시공 자료가 업데이트되면 바로 안내드리겠습니다.
        {{else}}
          The polyaspartic waterproofing product page is coming soon. We will update you as soon as product information and application data are available.
        {{/if}}
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <LinkTo @route="contact" class="btn">{{this.locale.t "nav.contact"}}</LinkTo>
        <LinkTo @route="downloads" class="btn-ghost">{{this.locale.t "footer.downloads.title"}}</LinkTo>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</article>